      "content": "lol goblin-proof vault? 😂 that's a funny way to put it. but seriously, it really does feel like something is actively messing with me. i'll swear i put a receipt right on top of my keyboard and then when i look back, it's gone. it's like they're playing tricks on me. \n\nbesides the apps, is there anything else i can do to make sure my records stay safe? i'm terrified that something is going to go missing and then i'll get audited and be in huge trouble because i can't find the proof.",
